  (text
    "WAVESHARE CORE2350B0 - OFFICIAL P1/P2/P3/P4 PIN NUMBERING"
    (at 18 24 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.6 1.6)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "fd5a3efa-2b8c-575d-a2fa-0019284ffe3f")
  )
  (text
    "GPIO0..7 = CPU D0..D7 through 330R. Keep inputs until a valid UI12 read cycle."
    (at 18 32 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.0 1.0)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "4fc96585-82fa-5575-8457-7e3bf3a993df")
  )
  (text
    "UI12 PADS - REMOVE ORIGINAL UI12"
    (at 218 24 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "a7685ee8-b605-59b6-8dfe-b704ebd07a59")
  )
  (text
    "UI14 PADS - REMOVE ORIGINAL UI14"
    (at 313 24 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "c5a1798d-5723-5c54-8113-49964abe22c0")
  )
  (text
    "Old MD0..7 / SEL0..3 / STB link is internal in firmware and is not wired."
    (at 218 177 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 0.9 0.9)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "30d50feb-d6f6-5ebc-a040-fa4d48d163fa")
  )
  (text
    "UI14 pad16 RC RESET: NC. GPIO13 senses UI12 pad33 SYSTEM RESET ONLY."
    (at 218 184 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 0.85 0.85)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "cb698a0a-808b-5e39-b045-61cd5ecf8ccc")
  )
  (text
    "UI14 pad 41 is not physical ADB; it drives the existing R108 + Q4 stage."
    (at 170 104 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 0.85 0.85)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "9369e7b4-404d-5c91-900c-5a60df330ef7")
  )
  (text
    "Retain original Q4 and the physical ADB pull-up R107."
    (at 170 111 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 0.85 0.85)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "20504576-754b-534a-bd84-a9fb5326717d")
  )
  (text
    "Q1/Q2 are true open-drain IRQ and system-reset pull-downs. Firmware HIGH turns the MOSFET on."
    (at 98 184 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.0 1.0)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "f83b7385-8abf-5bb1-9292-37281c5ef203")
  )
  (text
    "POWER: fit JP1 for IIgs power. REMOVE JP1 before USB is connected while IIgs is powered."
    (at 220 226 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.0 1.0)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "c2809462-02ca-54b1-852c-f16b2275346e")
  )
  (text
    "Direct-interface rule: Core2350B must be powered whenever the IIgs can drive a 5 V signal."
    (at 18 260 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.0 1.0)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "dbfbdb2d-2211-5e37-b75b-4917be816938")
  )
  (text
    "UART is 3.3 V. GPIO39 is occupied by the Core2350B onboard LED and is unused."
    (at 18 269 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.0 1.0)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "809f664a-d109-54f1-8fe9-b625183aed3e")
  )
  (text
    "RN1 4.7k: FIT for RP2350 A2 Erratum 9; optional/DNP for A3 or A4."
    (at 105 248 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 0.9 0.9)
      )
      (justify left)
    )
    (uuid "a7fbbf72-5dc8-565f-89e2-a461604e2524")
  )
